{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets whether to show alert for push notifications when app is in foreground."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setshowpushnotificationalert:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setShowPushnotificationAlert:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"show","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"show","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YES to show alerts in foreground, NO to suppress them (default)"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By default, iOS does not display notification banners when the app is in the foreground.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Enable this to show system notification alerts even when the app is active."}]},{"text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure based on app type:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationConfigManager {","","    func configureForAppType(_ appType: AppType) {","        switch appType {","        case .messaging:","            \/\/ Messaging apps typically handle notifications in-app","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        case .ecommerce, .news:","            \/\/ E-commerce and news apps benefit from showing all notifications","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(true)","","        case .game:","            \/\/ Games might want to suppress during gameplay","            Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","        }","    }","","    func temporarilyDisableForegroundAlerts(during action: () -> Void) {","        let wasEnabled = Pushwoosh.configure.getShowPushnotificationAlert()","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(false)","","        action()","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setShowPushnotificationAlert(wasEnabled)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNUserNotificationCenterDelegate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and use "},{"code":"Pushwoosh.ForegroundPush","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setShowPushnotificationAlert:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setShowPushnotificationAlert:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","title":"PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PW